                "The Liberal Party did not fill three seats, one in Håbo and two in Olofström. The municipal council election in Orsa was appealed against and carried out again. The reelection took place on 16 March 2003.  The results presented here are from the reelection in Orsa 2003."
              ],
              "2006": [
